{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game for office workers, with simple and intuitive gameplay that doesn\u2019t tax the brain. During work breaks, occasionally collect materials, open treasure chests, and build your own house. Experience the joy of luck when unlocking chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your boss comes for an inspection, click the hide button to quickly transform the game interface into a calendar. When tired from work, unwind by opening game chests\u2014 the surprise gifts inside will bring you happiness. Happy people are more creative. Keep going, hardworking folks!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809060/extras/ezgif-2165bd0459a9ea__1_.gif?t=1751722003\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809060?t=1751722003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809060/ae50d5047432eabcb6d7f85433e295afbbb2eaa4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751722003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809060/5603d3b80bd756ea59093b1979a5c33853d9e2c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751722003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809060/5603d3b80bd756ea59093b1979a5c33853d9e2c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751722003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game for office workers, with simple and intuitive gameplay that doesn\u2019t tax the brain. During work breaks, occasionally collect materials, open treasure chests, and build your own house. Experience the joy of luck when unlocking chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your boss comes for a